  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      172.82,
      390.5,
      217.58
    ],
    "text": "Issued by the Natural Hazards Early Warning Centre Issued at 10.30 a.m. 03 November 2026, valid for the next 24 hours.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      220.61,
      555.59,
      325.73
    ],
    "text": "For Multi-day boats in the Bay of Bengal deep sea areas PLEASE BE AWARE! The cyclonic storm \"Murasu\" has made landfall in India and it is expected to continue moving in a north-northwestward. It will gradually weaken into a 'cyclonic storm' by 11:30 a.m. today, and further into a 'deep depression' by 11:30 p.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      358.97,
      555.67,
      453.34
    ],
    "text": "Wind speeds in the sea areas marked in the map below, may increase to (65-75) kmph at times, heavy thundershowers can occur, and these sea areas will become very rough. The fishing and Naval communities are requested to remain vigilant regarding this situation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0,
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
